      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Bone Marrow Aspiration Study</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Clinical History</strong>- Generalised lymphadenopathy with splenomegaly lymphoma</p>\n<p><strong>P/S&nbsp;</strong>&ndash;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Bone marrow aspirate smear</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fragments</strong>: Seen / Not Seen</p>\n<p><strong>Smears</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9646%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Cells&nbsp;</td>\n<td>%age</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lymphoid cells&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Erythroid Precursors&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Myelocytes</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metamyelocytes</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neutrophils</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eosinophil</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Impression</strong>: Features are suspicious of Bone marrow infiltration by Non Hodgkin&rsquo;s Lymphoma.</p>\n<p><strong>Advice</strong>: Correlate with immunophenotyping for confirmation and characterisation.</p>",
